# An ability an object acquired is linked only to abilities acquired with it (CR 607.5): Agatha's Soul Cauldron exiles one
# Keen-Eyed Curator, and the +1/+1 counter it puts on the other Curator lends that one a second "{1}: Exile target card
# from a graveyard" (CR 613.1f). The second Curator exiles Dryad Arbor, Ornithopter and Lightning Bolt with the lent
# ability - land, creature, artifact and instant - yet its own "as long as there are four or more card types among cards
# exiled with this creature" counts only what its printed ability exiled, so it stays 4/4 with no trample.

